# CR 304.4: an instant can't enter the battlefield; if one would, it stays in its previous zone. Cryptic Coat cloaks the
# top card of Bot1's library, Lightning Bolt: a face-down 2/2 creature may be an instant card (CR 701.58a). Ephemerate
# exiles that creature and returns the card to the battlefield - face up, as the instant it is - so it can't enter and
# stays in exile. The Coat, attached to nothing, stays on the battlefield; Ephemerate is exiled by its rebound.
#
# Black Lotus pays the Coat; the Plains pays Ephemerate. Bot1 skips its turn-1 draw, so Lightning Bolt, the eighth
# card, is the top of the library when the Coat enters.

